{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> be the function defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/a/a8a1598bab52d590b8a2254416b4ea03632ac8ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=ax^2-\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"24\" /> for some positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5afa69197c4489c70754f8a7a6fac0164859cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(\\sqrt{2}))=-\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"21\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/5/2c5054942d26a48b25b1a200c879be046069ab47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=$\" width=\"28\" height=\"8\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/f/52f428e30af897e9990e9afbf8155026ab2e7084.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{2-\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{1}{2}\\quad \\text{(C) } 2-\\sqrt{2}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\quad \\text{(E) } \\frac{2+\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"433\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/8/c482bd8b926d16f386fe98b2b33a8c5777428561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=-\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/552bf62e0a75667af28edcc822fd4c16d5578ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2=0\\implies x=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"156\" height=\"17\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/7/fa71a7615836a5becf53116ba9cdd1e0f74c3913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\sqrt2)=0\\implies 2a=\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</